message.content:
{
 "action": "deliver_reel",
 "words": "It’s done. She’s on the tape. Tell her it’s real.",
 "intention": "Hand the physical evidence of Alma's voice to Rita so the daughter receives the message before the night ends.",
 "detail": "I pull the cassette player from my shoulder rig, eject the tape, and slide it across the counter to Rita. The red light on the recorder is off. I didn't delete anything. The reel is heavy in my hand, warm from the machine. I don't stay to watch the ballroom lights; I just make sure she has it."
}
